        "pt": "Here are Léa and Hugo. Léa is Brazilian. She is tall and very happy. Hugo is French. He is short and a little tired. Léa and Hugo are friends. They are in Paris. Léa is not tired. She is happy! Hugo is not sad. He is happy too.",
